---
kind: lore
id: north.blazeGymTrainers
title: Blaze Gym trainers
---

// Ignatius' gym is a quiz hall: every trainer asks a question first.

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="blazeGymSuperNerdQuill" who="blazeGymSuperNerdQuill" intro="Question one! What burns hotter, a candle or a Pyrodrake? Wrong! The answer is: battle!" win="The answer was you. You burn hotter." lose="Correct answer: me!" prize="1800"/>

<entry id="northQuillAfter" on="talk" target="npc.blazeGymSuperNerdQuill" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(blazeGymSuperNerdQuill))">
  @blazeGymSuperNerdQuill: Ignatius writes a new quiz every week. Last week's was all about eyebrows. His own.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="blazeGymBurglarFitch" who="blazeGymBurglarFitch" intro="I used to steal fire monsters. Now I train them. Ignatius says that's growth!" win="Growth hurts." lose="Stolen victory!" prize="1700"/>

<entry id="northFitchAfter" on="talk" target="npc.blazeGymBurglarFitch" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(blazeGymBurglarFitch))">
  @blazeGymBurglarFitch: Water beats fire. Everybody knows that. That's why Ignatius keeps the sprinklers turned off.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="blazeGymSuperNerdOona" who="blazeGymSuperNerdOona" intro="True or false: you are about to lose. True! Let's prove it!" win="False. Deeply, painfully false." lose="True! I knew it!" prize="1800"/>

<entry id="northOonaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.blazeGymSuperNerdOona" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(blazeGymSuperNerdOona))">
  @blazeGymSuperNerdOona: I've answered every quiz machine in this gym correctly. It's never once let me skip a battle. I think they're rigged.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="blazeGymBurglarRusk" who="blazeGymBurglarRusk" intro="The boss locked the gym for a month and I was stuck inside! I've had nothing to do but train! Hope you're ready!" win="A month of training and I still lost." lose="Worth the month!" prize="1700"/>

<entry id="northRuskAfter" on="talk" target="npc.blazeGymBurglarRusk" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(blazeGymBurglarRusk))">
  @blazeGymBurglarRusk: Thanks for finding the key. I can finally go home and feed my Kitling.
</entry>
